{"3951670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Landoff", "steam_appid": 3951670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on a Journey Across a Flooded World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a catastrophe that shattered civilization, scattered islands became humanity's last refuge. Start your adventure with a small motorboat, explore a vast open world, meet unique survivors, and transform a humble dock into your very own fuel hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every voyage leads to new islands, new characters, hidden secrets, and new opportunities to grow your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras/95401a5eac6bf6f2f3c389241c174547.avif?t=1785855490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras_big/95401a5eac6bf6f2f3c389241c174547.avif?t=1785855490 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Vast Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail freely between dozens of islands. Discover abandoned settlements, fishing villages, industrial facilities, lonely lighthouses, and hidden coves waiting to be explored.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely sail between islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the underwater world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden treasures and secret locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dynamic weather and a full day-night cycle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Fuel Hub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a simple dock and grow it into the heart of regional trade.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell fuel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your infrastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete delivery contracts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money and unlock new opportunities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras/4a7f3c38eef6b279bd961c106fcdd6c5.avif?t=1785855490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras_big/4a7f3c38eef6b279bd961c106fcdd6c5.avif?t=1785855490 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade and Transport Cargo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shipment has value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load cargo by hand, transport goods between islands, discover profitable trade routes, and build your own trading network.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport a variety of cargo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish and sell your catch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete contracts and deliveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your own economy through the choices you make</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Boat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A better boat unlocks new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install more powerful engines, increase your fuel capacity, expand your cargo hold, and prepare for longer expeditions across the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras/3fe308e31a4442fda57c7a62344bb303.avif?t=1785855490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras_big/3fe308e31a4442fda57c7a62344bb303.avif?t=1785855490 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Danger Lies Beyond the Horizon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone makes an honest living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bandits, pirates, violent storms, and dangerous waters will constantly put your skills to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the world collapse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who destroyed civilization?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what role did you play in its downfall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forgotten islands, uncover records from the past, meet unforgettable characters, and reveal the truth behind a world devastated by artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras/1724a84c4174b6ddb71a64bb1408cca9.avif?t=1785855490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras_big/1724a84c4174b6ddb71a64bb1408cca9.avif?t=1785855490 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras/b038f13820cfec3e180e35fd4074fa24.avif?t=1785855490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951670/extras_big/b038f13820cfec3e180e35fd4074fa24.avif?t=1785855490 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast open world with dozens of islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Above-water and underwater exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand your own fuel hub</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade and transport cargo between islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing and treasure hunting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your boat and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear exploration and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post-apocalyptic story filled with mysteries and discoveries</p><